    narr:narration """This hub centers on the [core feature of decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), defined as the primary product differentiator by anchoring artifacts at the moment of consensus. Recent activity from August 2026 demonstrates the practical application of this framework, as the team [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_1) and identified the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_3) as the critical unlock for this capability. Alongside these functional milestones, the team reports [record velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786268099549_2), framing the integration and the new widget as drivers of recent performance gains.""" ;
